      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The ability to upgrade the instance privacy level to a more private type in general would be really useful. Rather than downgrading, which might have negative consequences (people who don't want to be in public suddenly being dumped into public), allow only upgrades to, say, group+ or friends+ (hidden) so the instance can die off naturally. If current participants want a public instance, they can then create a new instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
