      "value": "@{61f78a0f5e81830b61f0e5bf|full_name}: You will be able to shut down these instance types, as long as you have the applicable permission (for Group instances) or are the instance creator or world author (non-Group):\n\n- Group Public\n\n- Group+\n\n- Group\n\n- Friends+\n\n- Friends\n\n- Invite+\n\n- Invite\n\nYou will not be able to shut down Public instances, even if you have moderation powers in them (world authors have this).\n\nThe ability to change types on the fly is out of scope of this feature request, but has been requested [elsewhere](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-for-world-instance-changes)!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
